Maestro II is a "virtual keyboard instrument" - it turns a Mattel PowerGlove
outfitted with a SIGArch PGSI adapter into a realtime MIDI controller, via
a PC running Microsoft Windows 3.1 with a MIDI interface.  Read the
MAESTRO2.WRI file (packed inside the .ZIP) for more information.

-Chris Wilson
